  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "59b180e9-7b87-492e-a56f-26af26141863",
   "r": [
    [
     "Inclusion",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     " 包容性"
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal_background"
  },
  {
   "t": "image",
   "id": "5b803607-b15e-428a-be2a-133411552e03",
   "r": [
    [
     "Untitled"
    ]
   ],
   "file": "images-inclusion/04.jpg",
   "w": 1600,
   "h": 900
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "1070cb1d-929b-4c8a-9564-45b3f734b77c",
   "r": [
    [
     "❗️包容性设计是非常重要的一节内容，笔记会比较多。",
     [
      [
       "h",
       "gray"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "62adaeb7-7f74-4923-bfe8-9822522569dd",
   "r": [
    [
     "As with all design, designing an inclusive app is an iterative process that takes time to get right. Throughout the process, be prepared to examine your assumptions about how other people think and feel and be open to evolving knowledge and understanding."
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "793ba621-646e-4490-a87d-b492b72f7bec",
   "r": [
    [
     "“正如所有的设计一样，设计一个包容性的应用程序是一个迭代的过程，需要花费时间来获得正确的结果。在整个过程中，"
    ],
    [
     "准备好检查你对其他人的想法和感受的假设，并对不断发展的知识和理解持开放态度。”",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "做有开放性的设计，是一个挺有挑战的事情，意味着要多想几个迭代，意识到功能的拓展性，在开放的基础上叠加创意，是有趣的挑战。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "bcd4b2d5-a991-47ef-8d5a-dc6b81e545d5",
   "r": [
    [
     "Inclusive by design 包容性设计",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "c559cf64-439b-4547-9257-585706ba0acd",
   "r": [
    [
     "Simple, intuitive experiences are at the core of well-designed apps."
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "66d69cd0-f747-4914-aae5-f14c509f084e",
   "r": [
    [
     "简单、直观的体验是 app 好设计的核心。",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "69b11b14-19de-448a-a855-344b61fd1f1b",
   "r": [
    [
     "Empathy is an important tool in this investigation because it helps you understand how people with different perspectives might respond to the content and experiences you create."
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "07be2bc2-6ca7-4d2e-b0f6-088be2645fdd",
   "r": [
    [
     "构建"
    ],
    [
     "同理心",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "是研究包容性设计中的一个重要前提，因为它可以帮助你理解不同视角的人对你创造的内容、体验的反应。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "435a147d-5592-41ea-b2a4-592f1a79be9b",
   "r": [
    [
     "Although each person’s perspective comprises a unique intersection of human qualities that’s both distinct and dynamic, all perspectives arise from human characteristics and experiences that everyone shares, including:\n尽管每个人的视角"
    ],
    [
     "都包含一个独特的人类特质的交叉点，既",
     [
      [
       "s"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "是独特的又是动态的，但是所有的视角都来源于每个人共有的人类特征和经历，包括:"
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal",
   "c": [
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "06993486-9521-462b-86b0-9f31ee977a4a",
     "r": [
      [
       "Age 年龄"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "c06d7d91-95ac-452f-96c2-f66560dbcfac",
     "r": [
      [
       "Gender and gender identity 性别与性别认同"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "c2bb7eca-873b-475f-a414-2b5cfec0d154",
     "r": [
      [
       "Race and ethnicity 种族和民族"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "a595f489-f614-47a7-aaa1-0e61895b9ee6",
     "r": [
      [
       "Sexuality 性取向"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "d15bde43-f71f-49e2-82a1-09b044399192",
     "r": [
      [
       "Physical attributes 身体特征"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "5144d212-01b2-489a-b330-b34c7c669807",
     "r": [
      [
       "Cognitive attributes 认知属性"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "c4694eca-23be-4c66-8bee-9f5036875dcf",
     "r": [
      [
       "Permanent, temporary, and situational disabilities 永久性，暂时性和情境性残疾"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "a8e15630-09f6-42f2-abe3-a537b7650c66",
     "r": [
      [
       "Language and culture 语言和文化"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "e96f1ea5-7b73-4a9d-9ca7-63835534a475",
     "r": [
      [
       "Religion 宗教"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "f5e82417-7511-4cfe-b373-9a694974c3a6",
     "r": [
      [
       "Education 教育"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "2763742f-c449-4b55-96ac-0d525da802be",
     "r": [
      [
       "Political or philosophical opinions 政治或哲学观点"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "bulleted_list",
     "id": "aeb1dc98-8500-4a51-b064-7c7aa7d2bc19",
     "r": [
      [
       "Social and economic context 社会和经济背景"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "f900d348-fba1-46eb-bbb1-71deba7e9094",
   "r": [
    [
     "我觉得，这些人类特征对于我们做前期的用户研究非常有帮助，可以从这些点出发去研究用户，总结画像。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "d43cf166-377d-4a54-be04-54d1dce3f655"
  },
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "c2816ebe-0486-4f20-9360-9130be0b77e8",
   "r": [
    [
     "Welcoming language 欢迎的语言",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "1ef3b649-0fdd-4ff7-abfb-101b6894389f",
   "r": [
    [
     "Using plain, inclusive language welcomes everyone and helps them understand your app."
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "5da22c60-11f6-4a3a-8f1b-fbadc2fa5673",
   "r": [
    [
     "使用简单、包容的语言欢迎每个人",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "，并帮助他们了解你的产品。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "1d23a59f-9c8f-4d02-919b-2bc703ab862f",
   "r": [
    [
     "Pay attention to how you refer to people.",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "891fffaf-2c1e-4395-b34a-8b49fecc51aa",
   "r": [
    [
     "注意对别人的称呼。",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "文案上建议使用“你”或“你的”，使用“用户”会让人感到疏远。另外，可以用“我们”指代公司/团队。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "b79d2268-7e1a-4803-9f40-a6f2aa9e5d96",
   "r": [
    [
     "Avoid using specialized or technical terms without defining them.",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "ff0b8532-e293-4f51-ac2c-7ba664341769",
   "r": [
    [
     "避免使用没有（普适性）定义的专业术语或技术术语。",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "即便用户知道这些专业术语的定义，但如果一开始就使用简单的语言代替专业术语，那么文案也会更加通俗易懂。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "d9d32916-1734-4979-8ef4-02e735df4fb4",
   "r": [
    [
     "Consider carefully before including humor.",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "h",
       "teal"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "32f9b674-eda8-4a72-8b6f-33fcae6a4e5b",
   "r": [
    [
     "仔细考虑一些包含地域性的“笑话”。这种算是极端情况，如果产品文案里面包含了一些带有地域、民族、时效性的“笑话”“段子”“梗”，要考虑那些不接受、不理解他的人的感受，或许会激怒他们或者让他们感觉不舒服。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "4977719b-0e5a-4257-9209-411b5dbf4d9d"
  },
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "3e23f759-20ce-4cd2-9b4b-de189da5333e",
   "r": [
    [
     "Being approachable 平易近人",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "1b1f9c8e-714b-451b-9b43-e349dbd3dd59",
   "r": [
    [
     "An approachable app doesn’t require people to have particular skills or knowledge before they can use it, and it gives people a clear path toward deepening their understanding over time."
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "a663adfa-e1dd-41ce-bdea-2ea56348452b",
   "r": [
    [
     "“一个平易近人的 app 并不需要人们拥有特定的技能或知识才能使用，而且它给人们提供了一个随着时间的推移加深理解的清晰途径。”茅塞顿开！"
    ],
    [
     "给用户提供一个能够推进且清晰的使用路径，在做新手引导设计时，这件事非常重要。",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "7eba1e16-6b6d-4cfd-94d6-114a61743edd",
   "r": [
    [
     "Consider designing a first-launch experience that helps new users take a step-by-step approach while letting experienced users skip straight to the content they want."
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "241e16f5-6e45-4b76-aed8-5951bb3f555d",
   "r": [
    [
     "“可以考虑设计一个首次发布体验，帮助新用户采取一步一步的方法，同时让有经验的用户直接跳到他们想要的内容。”也就是，对于新手来说，可以提供一个“新手任务”，但也应该允许用户直接跳过。参考我做过的案例👇"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "image",
   "id": "d7ea1228-1a8a-4e1a-8214-4abbcbf221d4",
   "r": [
    [
     "开放平台14.png"
    ]
   ],
   "file": "images-inclusion/05.jpg",
   "w": 1600,
   "h": 900
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "44855bcc-666e-4770-ac48-d2b6726223de"
  },
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "de0f47d4-35a4-40a5-9ee8-967f34953ee9",
   "r": [
    [
     "Gender identity 性别认同",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "3ac09b83-5002-4c9a-a62b-31a33a039b4f",
   "r": [
    [
     "在苹果看来，大多数 app 是不需要知道用户的性别的。因此，在设计中去除性别符号，将有助于促进包容性。例如使用这样的无性别图标作为用户头像。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "column_list",
   "id": "dc14e352-3a1d-4479-b41d-b33c520863b5",
   "c": [
    {
     "t": "column",
     "id": "0b6731bd-2f34-4b8f-82f8-cfd8ff4cf502",
