  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "ffabc6fa-f8f3-484b-a653-4aeb68e97f5c",
   "r": [
    [
     "but if your app requires this information — such as for health or legal reasons — consider providing inclusive options, such as "
    ],
    [
     "nonbinary",
     [
      [
       "i"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     ", "
    ],
    [
     "self-identify",
     [
      [
       "i"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     ", and "
    ],
    [
     "decline to state",
     [
      [
       "i"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "."
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "b182c8fc-b083-49cc-bf92-30701dbdbddc",
   "r": [
    [
     "“但是如果你的应用程序需要这些信息(比如出于健康或法律原因) ，可以考虑提供包容性选项，比如非二进制、自我识别和拒绝状态。”其中，最后一个拒绝显示性别，是目前比较主流的方案，相比起提供更多的性别选项来说，只提供一个后退选项，更容易实现。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "660d8c3d-1a08-4a59-8a5a-bd9488573a9c"
  },
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "121564ad-3826-49ed-b47d-c4ecb8caa7ce",
   "r": [
    [
     "People and settings 人物和环境",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "ca51d46e-73e9-4e91-827b-49f7ea9c57b9",
   "r": [
    [
     "When people recognize others like themselves within an app and its related materials, they’re less likely to feel excluded and can be more likely to think they’ll benefit from the app."
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "0832195c-78c5-420b-a91c-4c177bfd4d7f",
   "r": [
    [
     "“当人们在一个应用程序及其相关材料中认出与自己相似的人时，他们不太可能感到被排斥，更有可能认为自己会从这个应用程序中受益。”比如，app中推出了“这些朋友最近跟你听了一样的歌”、“他们之前也买了这件商品”，找到同好，总是会让人开心的。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "4fc63b2d-c03c-40e5-8b8c-df2e0a0e3d6e"
  },
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "9bb5b7ef-bc3d-4283-879d-70ee653fb89e",
   "r": [
    [
     "Avoiding stereotypes 避免刻板印象",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "b507af43-bbb5-4a90-8dd6-c3ee52a0e3b3",
   "r": [
    [
     "Everyone holds biases and stereotypes — often unconsciously — and it can be challenging to discover how they affect your thoughts."
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "8c96b61b-7d05-4c25-ad60-c033fd8ba2e6",
   "r": [
    [
     "“每个人都有偏见和刻板印象ーー通常是无意识的ーー而且要发现它们是如何影响你的想法是很有挑战性的。”当然不是每个人都能意识到自己的偏见，但产品设计中应该尽量认识到一些偏见，并且避免向用户传达，这涉及到一些框架规则。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "2357e720-16d4-4b94-bc51-c07abc54abc0",
   "r": [
    [
     "比如，在填写家庭成员资料时，默认提供一个父亲、一个母亲、还有孩子的页面框架，但这是狭义的做法，是我们对家庭的传统看法影响了我们去做这样的设计。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "2cc91f31-dc6c-480e-821b-8beec75b4583",
   "r": [
    [
     "在苹果提供的例子中，当一个 app 要求人们选择安全问题，可能会提供这样的问题供用户选择，例如:"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "bulleted_list",
   "id": "d3e7e391-2dc4-4f84-887f-284711011ebc",
   "r": [
    [
     "你在大学里最喜欢的科目是什么？"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "bulleted_list",
   "id": "1a1f0cc0-de01-4a7e-af6c-4963c0da2a13",
   "r": [
    [
     "你的第一辆车是什么牌子的？"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "bulleted_list",
   "id": "5a82cac0-ac93-4f90-b7f7-25af8fa27515",
   "r": [
    [
     "你第一次看到彩虹的时候是什么感觉？"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "812065cb-9d20-44ae-8f45-ba0b21d7bcc5",
   "r": [
    [
     "但这些问题关联的事情，并不是每个人都经历过，"
    ],
    [
     "避免过早给用户做出假设，是做问卷设计时一个比较重要的前提。",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "可以将问题换成更普遍的共同经历，例如："
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "bulleted_list",
   "id": "8e481495-9c3b-4d3b-8926-e0987a5c061b",
   "r": [
    [
     "你最大的爱好是什么？"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "bulleted_list",
   "id": "d21cb6b3-5485-4b33-9748-9d445dac39b1",
   "r": [
    [
     "你第一个朋友叫什么名字？"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "459fc8ad-f049-444b-a689-40c42c52eb0c"
  },
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "056bd29b-ddde-496d-9462-ecb855eba20e",
   "r": [
    [
     "Accessibility 无障碍",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "6d0e2642-84b7-4c04-8a09-0686d826b174",
   "r": [
    [
     "Prioritize simplicity and perceivability.",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "bbac89cf-509a-451c-a1e6-51141cd7151d",
   "r": [
    [
     "“优先考虑简单性和可感知性。”操作简单且一致、容易发现、任务容易执行，能够让更多的人理解app上的内容。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "fc7ca100-a4a3-438d-b280-35d81b37ed7f",
   "r": [
    [
     "无障碍相关设计指南可以参考这个链接"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "bookmark",
   "id": "3bc7f1b0-75d0-48cd-ba32-86664f810635",
   "href": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/foundations/accessibility",
   "title": "Accessibility",
   "desc": "People use Apple's accessibility features to personalize how they interact with their devices in ways that work for them. An accessible app or game supports accessibility personalizations by design and gives everyone a great user experience, regardless of their capabilities or how they use their devices."
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "754ec263-934d-4db2-a791-22c596808a83"
  },
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "b771c85e-6cc7-40a9-b352-346ee988f7a9",
   "r": [
    [
     "Languages 语言",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "2a9aa494-3fbd-4ef4-9510-83d5c03e0143",
   "r": [
    [
     "People expect to customize their device by choosing a language for text and a region for formatting values like date, time, and money. To welcome a global audience, first prepare your app to handle languages and regions other than your own — a process called "
    ],
    [
     "internationalization .",
     [
      [
       "i"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "e1087cc9-83aa-4b81-97a7-d3ea8240707b",
   "r": [
    [
     "在国际化的过程中，人们希望通过选择自己熟悉的文本语言和格式化日期、时间和金钱等，来充分为自己使用。所以说，这小节虽然叫语言，但却是广义上的语言，包括了除了口头使用的语言之外，还包括了能够用于国际化的符号、颜色等。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "7720af31-e9ce-4ea0-abbd-4c90b20cc714",
   "r": [
    [
     "有关国际化，可以参考这个链接"
    ]
   ]
  },
